wifi: p54: free the statistics request and wake the waiter without an interface

p54_rx_stats() returned early while no interface was added, without
freeing the request it answers or completing stat_comp. mac80211
configures the device before it adds the interface, and p54_config()
waits for statistics (WARN_ON(p54_wait_for_stats())): bringing the
interface up waited out five one-second timeouts with five warnings,
and leaked the requests. Skip only the accounting.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/intersil/p54/txrx.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/intersil/p54/txrx.c
@@ -531,8 +531,14 @@
 	unsigned int i, rssi, tx, cca, dtime, dtotal, dcca, dtx, drssi, unit;
 	u32 tsf32;
 
+	/*
+	 * Without an interface there's nothing to account the statistics to,
+	 * but the request still has to be freed and the waiter woken: mac80211
+	 * configures the device (p54_config() waits for statistics) before it
+	 * adds the interface.
+	 */
 	if (unlikely(priv->mode == NL80211_IFTYPE_UNSPECIFIED))
-		return ;
+		goto out;
 
 	tsf32 = le32_to_cpu(stats->tsf32);
 	if (tsf32 < priv->tsf_low32)
@@ -611,6 +617,7 @@
 		do_div(survey->time_busy, 1024);
 	}
 
+out:
 	tmp = p54_find_and_unlink_skb(priv, hdr->req_id);
 	dev_kfree_skb_any(tmp);
 	complete(&priv->stat_comp);
